{"type":"text","timestamp":1788461137412,"sessionID":"ses_f9768e42affeBCdOzqJEZa6KIu","part":{"id":"prt_068973507001oS0jWHcdCkU1c1","messageID":"msg_068973411001kBMGHZp74dAUX9","sessionID":"ses_f9768e42affeBCdOzqJEZa6KIu","type":"text","text":"I can see the issue now. The current implementation of `CeilDiv` simply performs integer division (`a / b`), but it should perform ceiling division, which rounds up to the nearest integer.\n\nLooking at the test cases:\n- `CeilDiv(0, 3)` should return `0` (0/3 = 0)\n- `CeilDiv(1, 3)` should return `1` (1/3 = 0.333... → ceil = 1)\n- `CeilDiv(6, 3)` should return `2` (6/3 = 2)\n- `CeilDiv(7, 3)` should return `3` (7/3 = 2.333... → ceil = 3)\n\nThe current implementation `a / b` performs truncating integer division, not ceiling division.\n\nLet me fix the implementation:\n\n","time":{"start":1788461135111,"end":1788461137404}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788461137412,"sessionID":"ses_f9768e42affeBCdOzqJEZa6KIu","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"w0NtZEwokd0IkG6W72SYchTi6f1BMRp8","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-72ogz382\\repair.go","oldString":"package repair\n\nfunc CeilDiv(a, b int) int { return a / b }","newString":"package repair\n\nfunc CeilDiv(a, b int) int { \n    if a < 0 || b <= 0 {\n        panic(\"CeilDiv requires nonnegative integer a and positive integer b\")\n    }\n    return (a + b - 1) / b\n}"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-72ogz382\\repair.go\n===================================================================\n--- C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-72ogz382\\repair.go\n+++ C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-72ogz382\\repair.go\n@@ -1,3 +1,8 @@\n package repair\n \n-func CeilDiv(a, b int) int { return a / b }\n+func CeilDiv(a, b int) int { \n+    if a < 0 || b <= 0 {\n+        panic(\"CeilDiv requires nonnegative integer a and positive integer b\")\n+    }\n+    return (a + b - 1) / b\n+}\n","filediff":{"file":"C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-72ogz382\\repair.go","patch":"Index: C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-72ogz382\\repair.go\n===================================================================\n--- C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-72ogz382\\repair.go\n+++ C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-72ogz382\\repair.go\n@@ -1,3 +1,8 @@\n package repair\n \n-func CeilDiv(a, b int) int { return a / b }\n+func CeilDiv(a, b int) int { \n+    if a < 0 || b <= 0 {\n+        panic(\"CeilDiv requires nonnegative integer a and positive integer b\")\n+    }\n+    return (a + b - 1) / b\n+}\n","additions":6,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"repair.go","time":{"start":1788461137407,"end":1788461137410}},"id":"prt_068973a51001Dscuoni9myPPbQ","sessionID":"ses_f9768e42affeBCdOzqJEZa6KIu","messageID":"msg_068973411001kBMGHZp74dAUX9"}}
